{
  "name": "Turn product photos in Google Sheets into AI video ads with Shotstack",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-9e37-79b992a6dd1c",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -60,
        -1010
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 1,
        "width": 760,
        "height": 790,
        "content": "## Turn product photos into AI video ads\n\nAnimate every product photo in a Google Sheet into a short vertical ad with Shotstack AI. Each product gets a moving clip, a voiceover, its name, its price and a call to action, saved to Google Drive and linked in the sheet.\n\n### How it works\n- A daily schedule reads the product rows and takes a few new ones, one at a time.\n- Shotstack quotes the cost of the animation first. A product above your credit limit is marked and skipped.\n- An image-to-video model animates the product photo.\n- Shotstack builds the ad around the clip, with a generated voiceover, and renders a 9:16 MP4.\n- The MP4 is saved to Google Drive, because Shotstack's render link expires after 24 hours. The Drive link and the credits go back to the row. A product that fails is marked with the reason, and the rest carry on.\n\n### Setup steps\n- Connect Google Sheets, Google Drive and Shotstack.\n- Pick the spreadsheet, the tab and the Drive folder.\n- Adjust **Ad settings**: the credit limit, products per run, motion prompt, models and call to action.\n\n### Good to know\n- The sheet needs the columns sku, name, price, image_url, voiceover, status, note, ad_url and credits. Leave voiceover empty and one is written from the name and price.\n- image_url must be a public link. Write the price as it should be shown and read, for example $49.\n- Generation is billed in credits, on Sandbox as well as Production. Clear a row's status to make its ad again.\n\n[Models and prices](https://shotstack.io/?utm_source=n8n&utm_medium=template&utm_campaign=ai-product-photo-ads)"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-9e37-79b992fadec1",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -60,
        -130
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1330,
        "height": 340,
        "content": "## Pick the products\nSet the limits once in Ad settings. Only rows with a photo and no status go through, a few per run, one at a time."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-9e37-79b9934ee066",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1360,
        -130
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 890,
        "height": 340,
        "content": "## Write the copy, check the price, animate\nThe words come from the row. A quote charges nothing, so only a product inside your credit limit is animated."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-9e37-79b993a2e20b",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2340,
        -130
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1110,
        "height": 340,
        "content": "## Build the ad and keep it\nShotstack lays the voiceover, name, price and call to action over the clip and waits for the MP4. The render link expires, so the ad is saved to Google Drive and the Drive link goes back to the row."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-9e37-79b993f6e3b0",
      "name": "Sticky Note4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1800,
        350
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 770,
        "height": 340,
        "content": "## Mark what was skipped\nA product over budget, or one Shotstack could not finish, is marked in the sheet with the reason, and the loop moves on. Clear its status to try again."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-9e37-79b98d12c127",
      "name": "Every day at nine",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "triggerAtHour": 9
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-9e37-79b98d66c2cc",
      "name": "Ad settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "max_credits",
              "name": "max_credits",
              "type": "number",
              "value": 15
            },
            {
              "id": "products_per_run",
              "name": "products_per_run",
              "type": "number",
              "value": 5
            },
            {
              "id": "video_model",
              "name": "video_model",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "seedance-2.0-image-to-video"
            },
            {
              "id": "motion_prompt",
              "name": "motion_prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Slow cinematic push-in on the product, soft studio light, gentle reflections, shallow depth of field"
            },
            {
              "id": "clip_seconds",
              "name": "clip_seconds",
              "type": "number",
              "value": 6
            },
            {
              "id": "voice_model",
              "name": "voice_model",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "elevenlabs-turbo-v2.5"
            },
            {
              "id": "cta",
              "name": "cta",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Shop now"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-9e37-79b98dbac471",
      "name": "Get the product rows",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.5
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-9e37-79b98e0ec616",
      "name": "Only rows without an ad",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "version": 2,
            "leftValue": "",
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "json-status-empty",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "empty",
                "singleValue": true
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
              "rightValue": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "json-image-url-notempty",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.image_url }}",
              "rightValue": ""
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.2
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-9e37-79b98e62c7bb",
      "name": "A few per run",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.limit",
      "position": [
        880,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "maxItems": "={{ $('Ad settings').first().json.products_per_run }}"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-9e37-79b98eb6c960",
      "name": "One product at a time",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "position": [
        1100,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {}
      },
      "typeVersion": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-9e37-79b98f0acb05",
      "name": "Write the ad copy",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        1420,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "headline",
              "name": "headline",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ String($json.name) }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "price_tag",
              "name": "price_tag",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ String($json.price) }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "voiceover",
              "name": "voiceover",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.voiceover || ($json.name + '. Now just ' + $json.price + '.') }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-9e37-79b98f5eccaa",
      "name": "Quote the animation",
      "type": "@shotstack/n8n-nodes-shotstack.shotstack",
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput",
      "position": [
        1640,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "model": "={{ $('Ad settings').first().json.video_model }}",
        "length": "={{ $('Ad settings').first().json.clip_seconds }}",
        "prompt": "={{ $('Ad settings').first().json.motion_prompt }}",
        "resource": "generation",
        "assetType": "video",
        "operation": "postGenerateQuote",
        "modelOptions": "={\"startSrc\": \"{{ $('Write the ad copy').first().json.image_url }}\", \"aspectRatio\": \"9:16\", \"resolution\": \"720p\", \"generateAudio\": false}"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
